<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>Last updated: October 7, 2026</p>
<h2>Short version</h2><p>rbxfun does not collect, store, or share personal data. We don't ask for your email, we don't run ads, and we don't track you across sites.</p>
<h2>What stays on your device</h2><ul><li><b>Theme preference</b> (light/dark) saved in your browser's localStorage as <code>rbxfun:theme</code>.</li><li><b>Intro flag</b> saved in sessionStorage as <code>rbxfun:intro</code> so the splash shows once.</li></ul>
<h2>In-game data</h2><p>Gameplay on Roblox (your avatar, ROL balance, holdings) is governed by <a href="https://www.roblox.com/info/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Roblox's Privacy Policy</a>. rbxfun processes no personal data outside the Roblox platform.</p>
<h2>Roblox accounts</h2><p>rbxfun is played with Roblox accounts, which are available to users 13+. We never ask for your Roblox password or .ROBLOSECURITY cookie — anyone who does is scamming you.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Privacy questions? Reach the team through the Roblox group <b>dodo'</b> or in-game.</p>
